
>> Product := Mea fou.
Product pe-a-oo-mai: ['a'] fai: { :price
	Tuuina-atu tusi: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Tuuina-atu tusi: [' cent a piece.'].


Numera pe-a-oo-mai: ['X'] fai: { :b
	b × ia-lava. 
}.
7 X { :i Tuuina-atu tusi: i. }.
